# Hit-confirm: the dummy randomly shields or gets hit. Hit: finish the combo (a second hit within 20 frames).
# Shield: stop safely (its grab out of shield must not land within 40 frames).
name: Hit confirm
about: Attack. On hit, confirm a second hit within 20 frames; on shield, stop and stay safe from its grab.
start: here
cpu: none
react: oos grab delay 2
adapt: shield
options: none all
weights: 4 4
trigger: dummy_hit_or_shield
success: confirm 20 40
par: 4
timeout: 360
loop: after 40
